{"seq":2,"slug":"qa-engineering","title":"QA 测试工程","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":6,"docCount":24,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering","rating":{"composite":4.23,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.85,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# QA 工程 简介\n\n软件质量保障（QA）是软件工程中至关重要却常被误解的领域。许多开发者将 QA 等同于\"手工点点点\"的测试执行，但现代 QA 工程早已演变为一套融合策略设计、自动化架构、性能安全分析、流程优化和工程文化的综合学科。本手册专门为程序员编写，帮助你从开发者视角理解 QA 的思维方式、方法论和实践体系，无论你是想与 QA 团队更好地协作，还是希望在自己的开发实践中内建质量。\n\n本手册适合以下读者：有一定开发经验但缺乏系统 QA 知识的程序员、希望转型为 SDET 或质量工程师的开发者、需要为团队构建测试体系的技术负责人，以及对质量工程感兴趣的任何技术从业者。阅读本手册不需要任何 QA 领域的前置经验，但需要具备基本的编程能力和对软件开发生命周期的了解。\n\n通过学习本手册，你将掌握如何制定适合项目的质量策略、如何设计和构建测试自动化体系、如何实施性能测试和安全测试、如何通过左移测试在开发早期发现缺陷、如何设计高效的 QA 流程，以及如何规划 QA 领域的职业发展路径。\n\n推荐的学习路径是按章节顺序阅读。第一章「质量策略」为整个体系打下理论基础，帮助你理解质量的定义、度量和文化建设。第二章「测试自动化架构」进入实践层面，讲解自动化金字塔、框架选型、CI/CD 集成和测试数据管理。第三章「性能与安全测试」拓展非功能性测试维度，涵盖负载测试、性能监控、安全测试和混沌工程。第四章「左移测试」聚焦开发者最应关注的领域，包括 TDD/BDD、代码审查、契约测试和开发者测试意识。第五章「QA 流程设计」从流程维度讲解敏捷测试、发布管理、缺陷生命周期和测试环境管理。第六章「QA 职业路径」为有志于 QA 领域发展的读者提供职业规划指南。\n\n如果你时间有限，建议优先阅读第一章和第四章——它们分别从战略和战术层面回答了\"程序员为什么要关心质量\"和\"程序员如何在日常开发中实践质量\"这两个核心问题。其他章节可以根据实际需要选择性深入。\n\n质量不是测试团队的专属职责，而是每一位工程师的内在追求。希望这份手册能帮助你建立起完整的质量工程思维，在职业道路上走得更远。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quality-strategy","title":"质量策略","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/quality-strategy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quality-models","title":"质量模型","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/quality-strategy/quality-models"},{"seq":2,"slug":"test-strategy-design","title":"测试策略设计","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/quality-strategy/test-strategy-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quality-metrics","title":"质量度量","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/quality-strategy/quality-metrics"},{"seq":4,"slug":"quality-culture","title":"质量文化","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/quality-strategy/quality-culture"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"test-automation-architecture","title":"测试自动化架构","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/test-automation-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"automation-pyramid","title":"自动化金字塔","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/test-automation-architecture/automation-pyramid"},{"seq":2,"slug":"framework-selection","title":"框架选型","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/test-automation-architecture/framework-selection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ci-cd-integration","title":"CI/CD 集成","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/test-automation-architecture/ci-cd-integration"},{"seq":4,"slug":"test-data-management","title":"测试数据管理","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/test-automation-architecture/test-data-management"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-security-testing","title":"性能与安全测试","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/performance-security-testing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"load-testing","title":"负载测试","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/performance-security-testing/load-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-monitoring","title":"性能监控","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/performance-security-testing/performance-monitoring"},{"seq":3,"slug":"security-testing-basics","title":"安全测试基础","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/performance-security-testing/security-testing-basics"},{"seq":4,"slug":"chaos-engineering","title":"混沌工程","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/performance-security-testing/chaos-engineering"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"shift-left-testing","title":"左移测试","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/shift-left-testing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"tdd-bdd-atdd","title":"TDD/BDD/ATDD 测试驱动开发方法","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/shift-left-testing/tdd-bdd-atdd"},{"seq":2,"slug":"code-review-for-quality","title":"代码审查与质量","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/shift-left-testing/code-review-for-quality"},{"seq":3,"slug":"contract-testing","title":"契约测试","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/shift-left-testing/contract-testing"},{"seq":4,"slug":"developer-testing","title":"开发者测试","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/shift-left-testing/developer-testing"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"qa-process-design","title":"QA 流程设计","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/qa-process-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"agile-testing","title":"敏捷测试","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/qa-process-design/agile-testing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"release-management","title":"发布管理","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/qa-process-design/release-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"bug-lifecycle","title":"缺陷生命周期","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/qa-process-design/bug-lifecycle"},{"seq":4,"slug":"test-environment","title":"测试环境管理","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/qa-process-design/test-environment"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"qa-career-paths","title":"QA 职业路径","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/qa-career-paths","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"qa-roles-evolution","title":"QA 角色演变","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/qa-career-paths/qa-roles-evolution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"qa-to-dev","title":"QA 转开发","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/qa-career-paths/qa-to-dev"},{"seq":3,"slug":"qa-leadership","title":"QA 领导力","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/qa-career-paths/qa-leadership"},{"seq":4,"slug":"quality-engineering","title":"质量工程","url":"/h/cross-discipline/qa-engineering/qa-career-paths/quality-engineering"}]}]}